@startuml
title Durable migration job state machine

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #EDF4FA
  BorderColor #315B7D
  ArrowColor #315B7D
}

[*] --> NEW : durable admission
NEW --> RUNNING

state RUNNING {
  [*] --> PREFLIGHT
  PREFLIGHT --> SHADOW_CREATING
  SHADOW_CREATING --> COPYING
  COPYING --> REPLAYING
  REPLAYING --> CUTOVER
  CUTOVER --> [*]
}

RUNNING --> SUCCEEDED : all phases complete
NEW --> CANCELLING : cancel
RUNNING --> CANCELLING : cancel before K
CANCELLING --> CANCELLED : cleanup complete (target)
RUNNING --> FAILED : terminal error

SUCCEEDED --> [*]
FAILED --> [*]
CANCELLED --> [*]

note right of RUNNING
  Every phase transition is persisted.
  Master reload bumps state_epoch and
  resumes non-terminal jobs.
end note

note right of SUCCEEDED
  Current: master-side role flip complete;
  manual SQL finalize is still required.
  Target: authoritative cutover is complete.
end note

note bottom of CANCELLING
  Current prototype marks CANCELLED
  without full resource cleanup.
end note
@enduml
